[Cheats/Enable Debug Mode Controller 1 Triangle+Circle+X+Square+Start will return you to the title screen.Select+Triangle will enable or disable progressive mode. Controller 2 debug inputs:Circle to toggle debug modes. Press this once or twice to enable sound test options in the Settings menu in the main menu. This will also open a scene select menu in the pause menu in-game.Square toggles a debug flag on or off. This will unlock all extras when enabled.]
